# OpenAPI

- One OpenAPI 3.1 YAML per microservice under `contracts/openapi/{domain}/`.
- Every operation: unique operationId, tags, summary, description, auth, permissions,
  tenant/branch behavior, params, body, examples, success + error schemas.
- Standard errors: 400, 401, 403, 404, 409, 422, 429, 500, 503.
- Headers: Authorization, X-Correlation-ID, Idempotency-Key where applicable.
- Shared schemas in `contracts/openapi/shared/`.
- Long-running ops return 202 with jobId, status, statusUrl, createdAt.
- Scripts: contracts:lint, generate, test, breaking.
- Generate TypeScript clients into `packages/frontend-api-client`.
